WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.556 --> 00:00:20.017
One day a husband and wife decided to make a gingerbread cookie.

2
00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:22.838
They cut the dough and baked it.

3
00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:28.079
When it was ready, they decorated its face with candy.

4
00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:32.233
"There!" The woman smiled.

5
00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:34.035
"He almost looks real."

6
00:00:34.955 --> 00:00:36.116
Her husband nodded.

7
00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:38.118
"He sure does."

8
00:00:39.199 --> 00:00:42.462
To their surprise, the cookie suddenly jumped up.

9
00:00:43.602 --> 00:00:44.944
He ran out the door.

10
00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:47.766
The couple ran after him.

11
00:00:47.786 --> 00:00:49.487
"Come back!"

12
00:00:50.248 --> 00:00:53.130
The cookie just laughed and ran faster.

13
00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:56.193
"Run, run, as fast as you can!

14
00:00:56.373 --> 00:00:57.494
You can't catch me.

15
00:00:57.734 --> 00:00:59.676
I'm the gingerbread man."

16
00:01:01.496 --> 00:01:03.998
Soon the cookie ran past a dog.

17
00:01:04.719 --> 00:01:05.840
The dog barked.

18
00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:09.883
"Mmm! I'm going to eat you!"

19
00:01:11.144 --> 00:01:12.466
The cookie laughed.

20
00:01:13.847 --> 00:01:16.569
"Run, run as fast as you can!

21
00:01:16.789 --> 00:01:18.170
You can't catch me.

22
00:01:18.471 --> 00:01:20.452
I'm the gingerbread man."

23
00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:25.136
The dog ran after the cookie, but the cookie ran faster.

24
00:01:26.578 --> 00:01:29.060
Soon the cookie ran past a child.

25
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:31.965
"Mmm!" the child said.

26
00:01:31.985 --> 00:01:33.826
"I'm going to eat you!"

27
00:01:34.607 --> 00:01:36.748
The cookie laughed.

28
00:01:37.408 --> 00:01:39.669
"Run, run as fast as you can!

29
00:01:39.849 --> 00:01:40.890
You can't catch me.

30
00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:42.570
I'm the gingerbread man."

31
00:01:43.151 --> 00:01:46.933
The child ran after the cookie, but the cookie ran faster.

32
00:01:47.893 --> 00:01:50.154
Soon the cookie ran past a cow.

33
00:01:50.855 --> 00:01:57.112
The cow mooed.

34
00:01:57.332 --> 00:01:59.313
"Mmm! I'm going to eat you!"

35
00:02:00.233 --> 00:02:01.473
The cookie laughed.

36
00:02:02.614 --> 00:02:05.614
"Run, run, as fast as you can!

37
00:02:05.795 --> 00:02:06.815
You can't catch me.

38
00:02:06.895 --> 00:02:10.576
I'm the gingerbread man."

39
00:02:11.996 --> 00:02:14.877
The cookie ran until he reached a river.

40
00:02:14.897 --> 00:02:17.478
"Uh-oh!" he said.

41
00:02:17.498 --> 00:02:18.818
"I can't swim!"

42
00:02:18.838 --> 00:02:21.839
"Do you want to cross the river?"

43
00:02:22.339 --> 00:02:24.239
someone asked.

44
00:02:24.360 --> 00:02:25.700
The cookie spun around.

45
00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:28.153
A fox stood nearby.

46
00:02:28.173 --> 00:02:29.814
"Oh yes!"

47
00:02:30.154 --> 00:02:31.574
the gingerbread man said.

48
00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:33.675
"Can you help me?"

49
00:02:33.695 --> 00:02:36.596
"Sure," the fox said.

50
00:02:36.616 --> 00:02:38.697
"Jump on my tail.

51
00:02:39.277 --> 00:02:41.238
I'll take you to the other side."

52
00:02:41.258 --> 00:02:45.900
"Great!" The cookie jumped onto the fox's tail.

53
00:02:46.961 --> 00:02:49.282
The fox started across the river.

54
00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:52.223
"Hmm," she said.

55
00:02:52.243 --> 00:02:54.704
"The water is getting deep.

56
00:02:55.512 --> 00:02:57.893
Why don't you climb onto my back?"

57
00:03:00.715 --> 00:03:02.296
The fox kept swimming.

58
00:03:02.316 --> 00:03:05.418
"The water is getting even deeper.

59
00:03:06.158 --> 00:03:08.679
Why don't you climb onto my nose?"

60
00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:11.661
"Okay," the cookie said.

61
00:03:11.681 --> 00:03:14.803
"Thanks for keeping me so safe."

62
00:03:14.823 --> 00:03:18.345
"No problem," the fox said.

63
00:03:18.365 --> 00:03:23.227
Then she gobbled up the cookie in one bite!

64
00:03:23.768 --> 00:03:29.457
Snap! At last everyone reached the river.

65
00:03:29.477 --> 00:03:32.758
"The gingerbread man is gone!"

66
00:03:33.258 --> 00:03:34.878
the child said sadly.

67
00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:36.819
The husband nodded.

68
00:03:37.859 --> 00:03:39.100
But the wife smiled.

69
00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.580
"Come home with us.

70
00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.701
We'll make another gingerbread man!"

71
00:03:43.921 --> 00:03:46.662
So everyone went home with the husband and wife.

72
00:03:47.282 --> 00:03:49.543
Together they made another gingerbread man.

73
00:03:50.303 --> 00:03:52.364
And this one was delicious!
